{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 40, :comments ["<b>And these are the names of the chiefs of Esau.</b> They were called by the names of their provinces after Hadar died and the kingship ceased from them. And those mentioned above are the names of their generations; and so it is explicit in Divrei HaYamim: ״וַיָּמָת הֲדָד וַיִּהְיוּ אַלּוּפֵי אֱדוֹם אַלּוּף תִּמְנָע״ and so on."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 36, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:02:19.711122Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}